<section style="width: 100%; margin: 0;">
    <div style="width: 100%; background: #C7CCDB; height: 350px;">
        <div style="float: left; margin: 65px 0 0 100px;">
            <h1 style="color: #1C1D21; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">Clean, Fresh, Organic Food</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 20px; width: 400px;">We source only the freshest, organic ingredients from local farms to ensure every dish bursts with natural flavor. Our commitment to quality means you can enjoy nutrient-rich meals that are both delicious and sustainable.</p>
        </div>
        <img class="float-right" style="margin: 65px 100px 0 0;" width="350" src="/images/home/feature-organic-foods.jpg">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 100%; background: #E1E5EE; height: 350px;">
        <div class="float-right" style="margin: 65px 100px 0 0;">
            <h1 style="color: #1C1D21; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold;">Affordable and Inclusive Meals</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 20px; width: 400px;">Eating healthy shouldn't be a luxury. Our diverse menu is designed to be both affordable and inclusive. Our menu caters to a variety of dietary preferences and maintains very high culinary standards.</p>
        </div>
        <img style="float: left; margin: 65px 0 0 100px;" width="350" src="/images/home/feature-organic-foods.jpg">
    </div>
</section>

